#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:58
msgid ""
"Add a mouse selector with hotplug detection and a second shortcut to switch "
"between mice."
msgstr ""
"Añadir un selector de ratón con detección de conexión y un segundo atajo "
"para cambiar entre ratones."

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:59
msgid ""
"Add Dark, Light and System color modes plus automatic startup and minimize-"
"to-tray options."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.freedesktop.Piper.appdata.xml.in.in:60
msgid "Add a system tray icon and a Quit menu entry."
